@startuml CPDO_LC_Simple_Use_Case

title CPDO Locational Clearance System\nSimplified Use Case Diagram

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

' Actors
actor "Applicant" as APP #LightBlue
actor "Zoning Officer\n(Admin)" as ADM #LightGreen
actor "Zoning Administrator\n(Super Admin)" as SA #Orange
actor "System" as SYS #Gray

' System boundary
rectangle "CPDO LC System" {
  
  ' Applicant Use Cases
  package "Applicant Portal" #F0F8FF {
    (Register Account) as UC1
    (Login) as UC2
    (Submit Application) as UC3
    (Upload Documents) as UC4
    (Upload Payment Receipt) as UC5
    (Track Status) as UC6
    (Download Certificate) as UC7
    (View Notifications) as UC8
  }
  
  ' Admin Use Cases
  package "Admin Portal" #F0FFF0 {
    (Review Applications) as UC10
    (Verify Documents) as UC11
    (Evaluate Application) as UC12
    (Set Payment Amount) as UC13
    (Verify Payment) as UC14
    (Generate Certificate) as UC15
    (Record Release) as UC16
    (Generate Reports) as UC17
  }
  
  ' Super Admin Use Cases
  package "Super Admin Portal" #FFF5EE {
    (Final Approval) as UC20
    (Reject Application) as UC21
    (Manage Users) as UC22
    (Send SMS Broadcast) as UC23
    (View Audit Logs) as UC24
    (Configure System) as UC25
  }
  
  ' System Use Cases
  package "Automated" #F5F5F5 {
    (Send Email Notification) as UC30
    (Send SMS Notification) as UC31
    (Generate App Number) as UC32
    (Log Activities) as UC33
    (Send Payment Reminder) as UC34
  }
}

' Applicant relationships
APP --> UC1
APP --> UC2
APP --> UC3
APP --> UC4
APP --> UC5
APP --> UC6
APP --> UC7
APP --> UC8

' Admin relationships
ADM --> UC2
ADM --> UC10
ADM --> UC11
ADM --> UC12
ADM --> UC13
ADM --> UC14
ADM --> UC15
ADM --> UC16
ADM --> UC17

' Super Admin relationships (inherits admin)
SA --|> ADM : extends
SA --> UC20
SA --> UC21
SA --> UC22
SA --> UC23
SA --> UC24
SA --> UC25

' System relationships
SYS --> UC30
SYS --> UC31
SYS --> UC32
SYS --> UC33
SYS --> UC34

' Include/Extend relationships
UC3 ..> UC32 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC30 : <<trigger>>
UC20 ..> UC30 : <<trigger>>
UC20 ..> UC31 : <<trigger>>
UC21 ..> UC30 : <<trigger>>
UC14 ..> UC30 : <<trigger>>
UC15 ..> UC31 : <<trigger>>

' Notes
note right of UC3
  **4-Step Application Process:**
  1. Applicant Information
  2. Project Details
  3. Land Use Information
  4. Requirements Upload
  
  Required Documents:
  • Location Plan
  • Tax Declaration
  • Title (if applicable)
  • Authorization Letter
  • Other requirements based
    on project type
end note

note right of UC15
  **Certificate Types:**
  • CZ - Certification of Zoning
  • CZC - Zoning Clearance
  • TUP - Temporary Use Permit
  • SUP - Special Use Permit
  
  Includes e-signature of
  Zoning Administrator
end note

note bottom of UC30
  **Email Triggers:**
  • Application submitted
  • Application approved/rejected
  • Payment verified
  • Certificate ready
  • Certificate released
end note

note bottom of UC31
  **SMS Triggers:**
  • Application status change
  • Payment reminder
  • Certificate ready for pickup
  • Requirements submission
  
  Customizable templates
end note

note top of SA
  Has all Admin
  permissions plus
  additional controls
end note

legend left
  |= Symbol |= Meaning |
  | --> | Association |
  | --|> | Generalization (extends) |
  | ..> | Dependency (include/trigger) |
  
  |= Actor |= Description |
  | Applicant | Citizens/Business owners |
  | Admin | Zoning Officer IV |
  | Super Admin | Zoning Administrator |
  | System | Automated processes |
endlegend

@enduml
